            "question": "1. Create a table dept1 as below with following columns:\nDEPTNO integer pk, dname varchar2(30) not null, loc varchar2(30) not null\n2.Add column mgr as number in the dept table.\n3. Create table empl with following columns\nempno integer ,ename varchar2(20) ,sal number(10,2) ,deptno number\n4. Add constraints on empl table\nEmpno-primary key, Ename-not null, Check sal>10000, Deptno as foreign key\n5.Create table dept11,emp11 from dept1,empl\n6.Add a new column address varchar2(30) in the empl table\n7.Rename sal column in empl table to salary\n8.Display constraints names and verify the names for the empl",
