            "question": "Write a program that displays the Top N salaries using simple Explicit Cursors.",
            "solution": "DECLARE\nCURSOR c1 IS\nSELECT ename,sal\nFROM emp\nORDER BY sal DESC;\n\nv_ename emp.ename%TYPE;\nv_sal emp.sal%TYPE;\nn NUMBER:=5;\ni NUMBER:=0;\n\nBEGIN\nOPEN c1;\n\nLOOP\nFETCH c1 INTO v_ename,v_sal;\n\nEXIT WHEN c1%NOTFOUND OR i=n;\n\nDBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE(v_ename||' '||v_sal);\n\ni:=i+1;\nEND LOOP;\n\nCLOSE c1;\nEND;\n/"
